# Converted books. A book's own licence governs its text, and plenty of
# them -- including "Introduction to Autonomous Robots" (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0),
# the one this reader was written for -- do not permit redistributing a
# converted copy. So no chapter and no built archive belongs in git; each
# person converts their own:
#     python3 tools/tex2ink.py ~/some-latex-book
*-[0-9][0-9]-*.json
